<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 30067 0 R/Alt(Three panels stacked vertically, one each for pregnancy-evidence likelihood, foreseeability and decision quality. In each panel the horizontal axis spans the full abortion-attitude scale, the lines run over the observed scores, and the vertical axis gives the predicted judgment over that judgment's full scale, with one line and shaded 95% band for each outcome condition: no information, expected evidence and unexpected evidence. Dotted vertical lines mark the attitude mean and one standard deviation below and above it.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[3]/Pg 77658 0 R>>
