<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 30696 0 R/Alt(Path diagram in black and white. Hostile sexism and benevolent sexism, on the left, each point to support for punishment and to abortion attitudes in the middle; both of these point to suspect punishment on the right. There are no direct paths from sexism to punishment. Each path carries its unstandardized estimate and robust Wald 95% interval; a solid path marks an interval that excludes zero and a dashed path one that includes it.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[2]/Pg 77666 0 R>>
