60573 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 60574 0 R/Alt(Path diagram in black and white. SMA information and NCM information, in two boxes on the left, each point to the evidence-relevance and evidence-incrimination factors, two ovals, which each point to abortion likelihood and miscarriage likelihood on the right. The four outcome-information paths carry one value per record (stereotypical, non-stereotypical), the factor's intercept; the four factor-to-likelihood paths one value. Each carries its unstandardized estimate and robust Wald 95% interval; a solid path marks an interval that excludes zero and a dashed path one that includes it.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[2]/Pg 77908 0 R>>
endobj
