<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 67744 0 R/Alt(Two panels. The first shows the basic model's average predicted probability of a yes ruling for all participants under None, SMA and NCM outcome information in their own evidence condition. The second shows the remaining model's average predicted probability under SMA and NCM information for the SMA and NCM participants, set to stereotypical and to non-stereotypical evidence. Each value is a point with its interval.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[30]/Pg 77976 0 R>>
